 "title": "Samuel's Touring Bike",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"> Building a Bamboo Bicycle: A Journey of Ecology and Self-Learning\n<style><!--\nbody {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            padding: 20px;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        h1, h2 {\n            color: #2E7D32;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 1em;\n        }\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #555;\n            margin-left: 20px;\n        }\n        .question {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n--></style>\n<p>Built at our workshop in <a href=\"https://bamboobicycleclub.org/pages/toulouse-workshop\" data-mce-href=\"https://bamboobicycleclub.org/pages/toulouse-workshop\">Toulouse find out more here\u00a0</a></p>\n<div class=\"question\">What made you decide to make a bamboo bicycle?</div>\n<p class=\"answer\">Combining ecology with self-learning/maintenance.</p>\n<div class=\"question\">Did you enjoy building your bike from A to Z and would you recommend this experience?</div>\n<p class=\"answer\">Mathieu really enjoyed the very enriching experience and recommends it to those around him.</p>\n<div class=\"question\">What did you find most challenging about building your bike?</div>\n<p class=\"answer\">Sanding and applying the unidirectional linen fiber.</p>\n<div class=\"question\">What was the easiest part of making it?</div>\n<p class=\"answer\">The varnish.</p>\n<div class=\"question\">How would you describe your feelings on your finished bike?</div>\n<p class=\"answer\">Fluid, responsive.</p>\n<p class=\"question\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?Nothing is perfect for me</p>\n<p class=\"question\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/DSC0530_-_Samuel_Forcet_480x480.jpg?v=1723229933\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/DSC0556_-_Samuel_Forcet_480x480.jpg?v=1723229937\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/DSC0556_-_Samuel_Forcet_480x480.jpg?v=1723229937\"></p>\n<style><!--\nbody {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            padding: 20px;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            color: #2E7D32;\n            font-size: 24px;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 1em;\n        }\n        .question {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n        .answer {\n            margin-left: 20px;\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #555;\n        }\n--></style>",
